#: ../../language/error_codes/E0079.md:1
msgid "E0079"
msgstr ""

#: ../../language/error_codes/E0079.md:3
msgid "Warning name: `implicit_impl_as_method`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../language/error_codes/E0079.md:5
msgid ""
"Methods from an `impl Trait for Type` declaration are being attached to "
"`Type` implicitly. This compatibility behavior is deprecated because it "
"is not explicit or refactoring-safe. The warning is disabled by default "
"in v0.10.4."
msgstr ""

#: ../../language/error_codes/E0079.md:9
msgid "Erroneous example"
msgstr ""

#: ../../language/error_codes/E0079.md:11
msgid ""
"///|\n"
"pub(open) trait Render {\n"
"  fn render(Self) -> String\n"
"}\n"
"\n"
"///|\n"
"pub(all) struct Badge(String)\n"
"\n"
"///|\n"
"pub impl Render for Badge with render(self) {\n"
"  self.0\n"
"}\n"
"\n"
"///|\n"
"pub fn show_badge(badge : Badge) -> String {\n"
"  badge.render()\n"
"}\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../language/error_codes/E0079.md:15
msgid "Suggestion"
msgstr "修正案"

#: ../../language/error_codes/E0079.md:17
msgid ""
"Use `extend Type with Trait::{method}` for methods that should support "
"dot syntax. If the compatibility method should remain available only for "
"migration, mark that `extend` declaration with `#deprecated`. Otherwise, "
"call the implementation as `Trait::method(value)`."
msgstr ""
"ドット構文をサポートすべきメソッドには `extend Type with Trait::{method}` を使用します。互換メソッドを移行期間だけ残す場合は、"
"その `extend` 宣言を `#deprecated` でマークしてください。それ以外の場合は `Trait::method(value)` として実装を呼び出します。"

#: ../../language/error_codes/E0079.md:22
msgid ""
"///|\n"
"pub(open) trait Render {\n"
"  fn render(Self) -> String\n"
"}\n"
"\n"
"///|\n"
"pub(all) struct Badge(String)\n"
"\n"
"///|\n"
"pub impl Render for Badge with render(self) {\n"
"  self.0\n"
"}\n"
"\n"
"///|\n"
"pub extend Badge with Render::{render}\n"
"\n"
"///|\n"
"pub fn show_badge(badge : Badge) -> String {\n"
"  badge.render()\n"
"}\n"
msgstr ""

#~ msgid ""
#~ "Use `extend Type with Trait::{method}` "
#~ "for methods that should support dot "
#~ "syntax. Otherwise, call the implementation "
#~ "as `Trait::method(value)`."
#~ msgstr ""
